(SECTION 1: REFUNDS AND BILLING) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (Standard customers may request a refund within 14 days) Tj
T* (of purchase. Refunds are issued to the original payment) Tj
T* (method and take 5 to 7 business days to appear.) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (Enterprise customers may request a full refund within 45) Tj
T* (days of the invoice date. Enterprise refunds require) Tj
T* (written approval from an account director.) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (Partial refunds are not offered for annual plans.) Tj
ET
endstream
