T* () Tj
T* (Standard customers receive email support with a response) Tj
T* (target of one business day.) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (Enterprise customers receive priority support with a) Tj
T* (2-hour response SLA during business hours, and a 4-hour) Tj
T* (response SLA outside them.) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (The support portal is available at all times except) Tj
T* (during scheduled maintenance windows.) Tj
ET
