(SECTION 3: ONBOARDING) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (The onboarding process for enterprise accounts takes) Tj
T* (approximately three weeks from contract signature.) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (Onboarding includes data migration, single sign-on) Tj
T* (configuration, and two training sessions for up to) Tj
T* (twenty five named users.) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (Standard accounts are self-serve and activate instantly.) Tj
ET
